<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>For My Dearest Dad ♡</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-decoration decoration-one">✿</div>
  <div class="page-decoration decoration-two">♡</div>

  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE BIRTHDAY SURPRISE ✿</p>
    <h1>Happy Birthday,<br><span>My Dearest Dad!</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      A little website made with lots of love, just for you ♡
    </p>
    <a class="main-button" href="#letter">Open your little gift ↓</a>
    <div class="hero-flower">🌼</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="letter paper" id="letter">
      <p class="section-label">A LETTER FOR YOU ♡</p>
      <h2>Dear Dad,</h2>
      <p>
        Happy birthday to the most wonderful dad!
        Thank you for being part of my life, for all the little things
        you do, and for making our home feel special.
      </p>
      <p>
        I may not always say it out loud, but I appreciate you more
        than words can explain. I hope your days are filled with
        happiness, good health, and all the things you love.
      </p>
      <p class="signature">With all my love,<br>Your little girl ♡</p>
    </section>

    <section class="memories">
      <p class="section-label">LITTLE THINGS, BIG LOVE ✿</p>
      <h2>Our Little Memory Garden</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        A tiny place for memories that mean so much.
      </p>

      <div class="memory-grid">
        <article class="memory-card">
          <img src="assets/apple-stickers.jpg" alt="Cute apple stickers">
          <h3>Sweet Memories</h3>
          <p>Little moments with you are worth keeping forever.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="memory-card">
          <img src="assets/clover-stickers.jpg" alt="Cute clover stickers">
          <h3>My Good Luck</h3>
          <p>I'm lucky to have you as my dad. Thank you for everything!</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="thank-you paper">
      <p class="section-label">A LITTLE REMINDER ♡</p>
      <h2>Thank You, Dad!</h2>
      <p>
        Thank you for your love, your patience, and the things you do
        even when nobody notices. I hope I can make you proud, too.
      </p>
      <div class="big-love">I love you, Dad! ♡</div>
    </section>

    <section class="surprise">
      <div class="surprise-flower">🍀</div>
      <p class="section-label">ONE LAST LITTLE SURPRISE</p>
      <h2>Do you know how much I love you?</h2>
      <p>There's a tiny message waiting for you!</p>

      <button class="main-button" id="surpriseButton" type="button">
        Open my message ♡
      </button>

      <div id="surpriseMessage" class="surprise-message" hidden>
        <h3>Of course, I love you! ♡</h3>
        <p>
          No matter how much I grow up, I'll always be your little girl.
          Happy birthday, Dad. You mean so much to me! 🌷
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Made with love, just for Dad ♡
    <p>© A little birthday surprise</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>